        <div class="lp-footer__group"><p class="lp-footer__heading">The fine print</p><p class="lp-footer__small">Payment plans are arranged through financing partners and are subject to approval. Monthly figures are illustrations over 12 months with an assumed 12% total charge, not lender offers. Ora coordinates planned care and does not provide clinical services. Suitability, preparation and the final price are set by the treating clinician. Photography and video are illustrative.<% if demo_mode? %> This preview uses demonstration providers, prices and financing; no real appointments, credit decisions or payments are made.<% end %></p></div>
